			"date": "2025-07-21T22:29:36.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Would you accept a PR that rips out vitest in favor of Node’s built-in test and assert libraries? 😂</p><p>(I’m mostly serious but would also accept being told to pound sand.)</p>",
