		{
			"id": "114898991441047726",
			"parentId": "114893558707913685",
			"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat/114898991441047726",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/accounts/avatars/109/286/461/031/266/152/original/dc489c3746a44e00.png"
			},
			"date": "2025-07-22T21:24:33.891Z",
			"content": "<p>One more entry in my epic date parsing adventure. I’ve shipped a breaking change to this library to ensure that all valid date strings supported in Eleventy v4 will be RFC 9557-compatible, ensuring friendliness with the standardized Temporal APIs coming to a JavaScript runtime near you. Our full test suite runs against both!</p><p>Read (a little) more: <a href=\"https://github.com/11ty/parse-date-strings/releases/tag/v2.0.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">github.com/11ty/parse-date-str</span><span class=\"invisible\">ings/releases/tag/v2.0.0</span></a></p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "114914219060916226",
			"parentId": "114893579904362800",
			"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat/114914219060916226",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/accounts/avatars/109/286/461/031/266/152/original/dc489c3746a44e00.png"
			},
			"date": "2025-07-25T13:57:08.934Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@cbirdsong\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>cbirdsong</span></a></span> I ended up doing a pivot after you asked this question — so I appreciate you asking it!</p><p><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat/114913999540366417\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachle</span><span class=\"invisible\">at/114913999540366417</span></a></p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "114914220548248533",
			"parentId": "114898991441047726",
			"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat/114914220548248533",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/accounts/avatars/109/286/461/031/266/152/original/dc489c3746a44e00.png"
			},
			"date": "2025-07-25T13:57:31.627Z",
			"content": "<p>I wrote this saga up in blog post form: <a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat/114913999540366417\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachle</span><span class=\"invisible\">at/114913999540366417</span></a></p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
